astBallMaster_Screenshot2.png", "id": "1876173739873412", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393444_1876173743206745_6763138395539482801_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nIKnSwSt-cYQ7kNvwHdd1Fa&_nc_oc=AdmumeGvRFHOZT8QR_30jqIB4ZmJzZ3YYbUVHsRpaLUe38_wVxqAkpf0NXuz1FpAg50&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftVCYz97WbEYdAdZpyIHOJpITEJsoDUcItlmVV3Lynjqg&oe=699ED573"}, {"file_name": "BlastBallMaster_Screenshot5.png", "id": "1157934832465543", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400793_1157934839132209_1607817201009102730_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KOqHupvuCXsQ7kNvwHT5l0V&_nc_oc=AdmdX2vLYUD46PtWSYl9co4fxRV-0I5oacB0JTrimHJbOrQQPshjodQX-GHKwJq5f_U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftQG7Y2kPzrSejFXf9puz8eh30llHPdf3cGY8yI-gSG8w&oe=699ED616"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "BlastBallMaster_Logo (2560x1440).png", "id": "1355890215582535", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819281_1355890218915868_2056131209238582864_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ISBZEWs_i48Q7kNvwE4_1Vv&_nc_oc=AdleQ7a9NPYkIr9RPp9SEZZd86VNpizxtQDpffh4B-NP3A8KV5Jy7TipIcI-PLSE7HY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsKpdUCLyI34YM_dOaFrog7jHHcosQ76bZmzvzlUSkm2Q&oe=699EF4BD"}, "display_name": "Blast Ball Master", "keywords": ["ball", "shoot", "bubble", "match3", "puzzle"], "long_description": "Blast Ball Master is a new vision of the old school Zuma game. \nBlast Ball Master is a puzzle game with a new creative idea.\nBlast Ball Master is interactive and immersive game. Be inside VR.\nBlast Ball Master is a good choice for those who love shooting ball game.\n\nUse 4 boosters: Slow, Freeze, Explosion and Backward Moving! \nUse challenges to get free coins!\nEnjoy colorful effects! \nCool fun music!\nTry different VR hands to get an additional bonus.\nTry Blast Ball Master now!  ", "short_descrip